<title>POLAND: Polish NBP raises max 7-day revrepo to 22.90 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP raises max 7-day revrepo to 22.90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland raised its maximum seven-day reverse repo rate by 0.39 point to 22.90 percent at the Thursday operation draining 599 million zlotys from the market, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Demand at the auction was 668 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
